ass=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Atypical, Asymmetrical UV aplasia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>/h</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ypoplasia</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1482]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tubal Hypo</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>plasia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>/Aplasia one or both</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1483]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ovarian malformation one or both</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1484]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Renal Anomalies</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1485]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marke